  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen regional mechanisms of coordination to combat IUU fishing in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyse the IUU fishing situation in the West Africa region; 
Strengthen the regional coordination and capacity to combat IUU fishing of FCWC and SRFC, with the overall supervision of ECOWAS;
Develop and validate a Regional Strategic Framework (RSF) and Action Plan (AP) for the fight against IUU fishing in West Africa</narrative>
  </description>
